IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dfrdb76-rules`

-- Independent tests: expected values from independent-expectations.md,
-- written from the source text before reading the rules module.

GIVEN sch IS A `Scheme`
      yr IS A `Increase year`
      a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      amt IS A NUMBER
      pk IS A `Period kind`
      ev IS A DATE
      pay IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
inc sch yr a b c d amt pk ev pay MEANS
    `my 1976 Act increase for` (`Pension 1976` OF sch, yr, a, b, c, d, amt, pk, ev, pay)

DECIDE dfrb IS `a DFRB pension`
DECIDE dfrdb IS `a DFRDB pension benefit`
DECIDE ns IS `not scaled`
DECIDE after IS `counted from the day after the retirement or death`
DECIDE fromPay IS `counted from the day the pension became payable`
DECIDE z IS Date 1 1 1960

-- 1-9: Part II prescribed percentage
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 140
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 120 100 112.34 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 123
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 103.33 100 110 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 47
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 103.32 100 110 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 46
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 103.25 100 110 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 46
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 100 100 115 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 0
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 100 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 0
#ASSERT inc `a DFRB pension for an eligible child` `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 0
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1974-75` 110 100 115 100 1000 ns z z EQUALS 140

-- 10-18: s 10 (14% of 1500 = 210)
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 ns (Date 30 9 1971) (Date 1 10 1971) EQUALS 210
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 after (Date 1 10 1971) (Date 2 10 1971) EQUALS 210
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 after (Date 31 12 1972) (Date 1 1 1973) EQUALS 60
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 after (Date 16 1 1973) (Date 17 1 1973) EQUALS 50
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 after (Date 15 1 1973) (Date 16 1 1973) EQUALS 60
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 fromPay (Date 1 1 1973) (Date 1 1 1973) EQUALS 60
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 fromPay (Date 15 6 1973) (Date 15 6 1973) EQUALS 10
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 fromPay (Date 16 6 1973) (Date 16 6 1973) EQUALS 0
-- 18: retirement (s 10(1)(a), not s 82ZB) on 20 Jun 1973: s 10(3) does not bar it; 1 month
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1973-74` 110 100 115 100 1500 after (Date 20 6 1973) (Date 21 6 1973) EQUALS 10

-- 19-22: s 11, 1974-75 (12% of 1000 = 120)
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1974-75` 110 100 112 100 1000 ns (Date 30 6 1973) (Date 30 6 1973) EQUALS 120
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1974-75` 110 100 112 100 1000 fromPay (Date 1 1 1974) (Date 1 1 1974) EQUALS 60
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1974-75` 110 100 112 100 1000 fromPay (Date 16 6 1974) (Date 16 6 1974) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT inc dfrb `1974-75` 110 100 112 100 1000 fromPay (Date 15 6 1974) (Date 15 6 1974) EQUALS 10

-- 23-32: Part III
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 1000 ns z z EQUALS 176
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.64 100 0 0 1000 ns z z EQUALS 176
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.65 100 0 0 1000 ns z z EQUALS 177
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 100 100 0 0 1000 ns z z EQUALS 0
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 400 ns z z EQUALS 70.4
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 1000 after (Date 1 7 1974) (Date 2 7 1974) EQUALS 176
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 1000 after (Date 31 12 1974) (Date 1 1 1975) EQUALS 88
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 1000 after (Date 15 6 1975) (Date 16 6 1975) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 1000 after (Date 10 6 1975) (Date 11 6 1975) EQUALS 176/12
#ASSERT inc dfrdb `1975-76` 117.6 100 0 0 1000 ns (Date 1 3 1975) (Date 1 3 1975) EQUALS 176
